{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11108010","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11108010","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1110801001:0":{"text":"Alrighty, let's get down to business.","source_cn":"好了，我们该忙起来了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55FAA77C4FD36EDE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110801002:0":{"text":"After being away for so long, there must be a lot for us to deal with!","source_cn":"离开了这么久，族里一定有很多事需要我们处理！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC848342BE73E506E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1110801003:0":{"text":"Alsa! You're finally back!","source_cn":"阿尔萨姐姐！你们终于回来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D11394701D222B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1110801004:0":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">Simba</style>... and everyone... *Sob*","source_cn":"<style=highlight>瑟巴</style>...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4D0D114DF78BF89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1110801005:0":{"text":"Oh no, a girl as adorable as you shouldn't be shedding tears. Let me guess, did Simba try to bully you?","source_cn":"哈，我们可爱的哈佩怎么了？别哭别哭，让我猜猜，是小瑟巴...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD39BF9FEDD0BB294","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1110801006:0":{"text":"No... he didn't... I'm scared because everyone went on a <style=\"highlight\">treasure hunt</style>, but it's been a long time, and they still haven't returned.","source_cn":"不……没……大家吵着要去<style=highligh...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x568DA3553BD250C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1110801006":{"text":"No... he didn't... I'm scared because everyone went on a <style=\"highlight\">treasure hunt</style>, but it's been a long time, and they still haven't returned.","source_cn":"不……没……大家吵着要去<style=highlight>寻宝</style>，但到现在一点消息都没有，哈佩很害怕……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x568DA3553BD250C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1110801007:1":{"text":"When Alsa and Soren left for the Warsong Festival, a group of merchants stopped nearby. They had many large bags and tall horses...","source_cn":"阿尔萨姐姐和索恩哥哥出发参加战歌节之后，有一群路过卖东...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B349F7D74C6A6B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1110801008:1":{"text":"They said, \"Towards the sunrise, <style=\"highlight\">treasures are hidden in the Eroded Enclave</style>.\"","source_cn":"他们说，往太阳升起的方向，那边的<style=high...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04112BE8B5436381","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1110801009:1":{"text":"Then, Simba and some of the big kids decided to go find the treasure with those people!","source_cn":"听到宝藏的消息，瑟巴，还有其他一些哥哥姐姐，决定要跟那...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10910E30ECF889AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1110801010:1":{"text":"And they haven't sent any messages back yet?","source_cn":"……但他们到现在也没传回消息？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F52D49877A5F820","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1110801011:0":{"text":"No... I waited for a long, long time until all of you returned, but there was still no word from them. I'm so worried...","source_cn":"没有……我在族里等了很久很久，直到你们都回来了，他们还...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D6CCBEADE701062","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1110801012:0":{"text":"Don't worry, we're here for you. Soren and I will definitely bring them back.","source_cn":"别怕，有我们在。我和索恩一定会把他们带回来的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BE3CDC1D4046A8A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1110801013:0":{"text":"*Sigh* Those young ones are so silly...","source_cn":"唉，真是一群傻孩子……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x246392EB2CAECF4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:21:1110801013":{"text":"*Sigh* Those young ones are so silly...","source_cn":"唉，真是一群傻孩子……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x246392EB2CAECF4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1110801014:1":{"text":"I'm older than them! As their elder sister, I have the responsibility to take good care of them!","source_cn":"我比他们大！作为大家的姐姐，当然应该承担起照顾他们的责任！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D93317E1E03B02A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1110801015:1":{"text":"Soren, pack up! Let's head out and find them!","source_cn":"不能再耽误了。索恩，收拾一下，我们马上就出发！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8174B09045724E81","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1110801016:0":{"text":"Okay, just calm down and think things through.","source_cn":"冷静一下，好好想想。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E278106FD64FEFF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1110801017:1":{"text":"The Uru Clan needs a leader in charge while we're gone.","source_cn":"我们离开这么久，现在乌尔氏族需要有人统领。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18FA009BCD5F1206","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1110801018:1":{"text":"You stay. I'll go look for them.","source_cn":"你留下，我去找。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B1F561FC0B6B8FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1110801019:1":{"text":"Soren! Y-You've finally grown up!","source_cn":"索恩……你……你终于成熟起来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC007095945908AB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1110801020:1":{"text":"You're clumsy, you going there would only slow things down.","source_cn":"你冒冒失失的，去了也会拖后腿。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD47C9D8F1713C10","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1110801021:1":{"text":"Hey! I take what I said back!","source_cn":"——我收回前言！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0CF19F8173365E79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:30:1110801021":{"text":"Hey! I take what I said back!","source_cn":"——我收回前言！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0CF19F8173365E79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1110801022:1":{"text":"Exactly! That Hypogean posing as Merlin could very well still be lurking nearby, scheming away!","source_cn":"对！那个假扮梅林的恶魔，说不定还藏在附近，筹划着阴谋。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB52A0B88F19ED438","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Exactly! That Hypogean posing as Merlin could very well still be lurking nearby, scheming away!","female":"Exactly! That Hypogean posing as Merlin could very well still be lurking nearby, scheming away!","variant_male_record_index":"122562","variant_female_record_index":"122563","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1110801023:1":{"text":"Hammie is right! If what Soren is looking into is connected to that Hypogean's bad intentions, it could spell trouble!","source_cn":"就是就是，万一索恩要调查的事情和那家伙的坏主意有关，就糟了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E8384A70E038385","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1110801024:1":{"text":"And word about the treasure happens to come from the Eroded Enclave...","source_cn":"宝藏传言，还恰巧是从风蚀飞地传出……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6EBBB49255529189","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:38:1110801024":{"text":"And word about the treasure happens to come from the Eroded Enclave...","source_cn":"宝藏传言，还恰巧是从风蚀飞地传出……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6EBBB49255529189","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1110801025:1":{"text":"It's the worst place of all.","source_cn":"最糟糕的地方。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x380A6A732B4616BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1110801026:1":{"text":"Those ruthless fortune seekers cast aside their pride and honor.","source_cn":"那里的人都是追逐利益的狂徒，把自尊和荣誉抛于脑后。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57060DF310B622D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1110801027:1":{"text":"While Maulers also inhabit the area, it's more like a melting pot of different tribes, unlike the Ashen Wastes where the bond through bloodlines is exceptionally strong.","source_cn":"虽然也有蛮血在活动，但各个部族杂居，并非荒角沙漠这样以...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F2C52C4022A57EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1110801028:1":{"text":"That place is a hotbed of danger and chaos. I wonder what treasure could be hidden in a place like that?","source_cn":"既混乱，又危险。\\n我倒是很好奇，究竟什么宝藏会埋藏在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE6EF01029AAED3B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1110801029:1":{"text":"She mentioned large bags and tall horses... Sounds like they went to the Eroded Enclave with some <style=\"highlight\">foreign caravans</style>.","source_cn":"卖东西的人、马儿和货物……听起来像是商队。你们的族人应...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C8D3B903ED4B3C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1110801030:1":{"text":"We will find Simba and the others if we find the caravans!","source_cn":"那么，只要找到商队，就能找到小瑟巴他们了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DA5DBE763F87EEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1110801031:1":{"text":"Alright, the clock is ticking! Soren, please bring our family back to where they belong!","source_cn":"那就这么定了！时间不等人。索恩，一定要把我们的家人带回来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x581D61EE73994C31","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1110801032:0":{"text":"Will do. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, let's go.","source_cn":"嗯。<style=stress><player_nam...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x421A7F4F07077AB4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Will do. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, let's go.","female":"Will do. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, let's go.","variant_male_record_index":"122573","variant_female_record_index":"122574","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn